WEBVTT
Language: en

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Did she impress you today?

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.000
She really surprises me — it's true
that she ended up in front like that…

3
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Christophe did a very, very good job
on this ride — it was incredible.

4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
He really took responsibility;
he was in front.

5
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Her aptitude for the ground
also made a big difference.

6
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:17.000
She's a really good filly.
I've liked her since the start of the season.

7
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:19.000
She's my best filly.

8
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:22.000
And I think she'll keep doing good things
between now and the end of the year.

9
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Don't you prefer Data,
who did well the other day?

10
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Yes, of course — I love them all.

11
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Obviously I expected, since they were
at roughly the same level,

12
00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:34.000
to see them finish together.
Today we really see what Woot Woot
can do.

13
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:36.000
This one — what does Woot Woot
have more than the others?

14
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:38.000
She's incredible.

15
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:40.000
From the start, she's always there when you ask.

16
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Since the start of the season in her work,

17
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:45.000
and she's always been very tough.

18
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:48.000
She's a really good filly by Sumbe.

19
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:50.000
I'm especially fond of all of them.

20
00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:52.000
And by the end of the year, I think
she'll make some nice trips.

21
00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Is she a filly for the Marcel Boussac?

22
00:00:54.000 --> 00:01:00.000
We keep that as an option, but for her owners
it's obvious we're also keeping the Breeders' Cup in mind.

23
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:02.000
That's in America?

24
00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:02.950
Yes.
